---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { ORG } from '../consts.js';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | BGS Technologies"
  description="How BGS Technologies collects, uses, stores and protects personal data submitted through bgstech.ae, and the rights you have over that data."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lastUpdated="29 October 2026"
  lastUpdatedISO="2026-10-29"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>{ORG.legalName}</strong> ("BGS Technologies", "we", "us")
    collects, uses, stores and protects personal data when you use
    <a href="https://bgstech.ae">bgstech.ae</a> or engage us for services.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    BGS Technologies is a marketing, technology and AI services company registered in the United Arab
    Emirates, with offices at {ORG.streetAddress}, {ORG.addressLocality}, UAE. For any privacy question
    or request, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${ORG.email}`}>{ORG.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you give us</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Name, email address, phone number and company name submitted through our contact and offer forms.</li>
    <li>The service you are interested in, your indicated budget range, how you heard about us, and any message you write.</li>
    <li>Any information you share with us during a strategy call, in email, or over WhatsApp.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Standard server and request data such as IP address, browser type, device type and referring page.</li>
    <li>Usage data about which pages you visit and how you arrived, where analytics are enabled.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    We do not knowingly collect special categories of personal data, and we do not collect
    data from children under 16.
  </p>

  <h2>3. How we use your data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>To respond to enquiries</strong> — contacting you about a strategy call, proposal or offer you requested.</li>
    <li><strong>To deliver our services</strong> — managing campaigns, projects and reporting for clients.</li>
    <li><strong>To improve the website</strong> — understanding which content and pages are useful.</li>
    <li><strong>To send marketing communications</strong> — only where you have opted in, and with an unsubscribe link in every message.</li>
    <li><strong>To meet legal obligations</strong> — including accounting, tax and regulatory requirements.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Legal bases for processing</h2>
  <p>
    Where the UAE Personal Data Protection Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021) or the EU/UK GDPR
    applies, we rely on: your <strong>consent</strong> (marketing communications), the
    <strong>performance of a contract</strong> (delivering services you have engaged us for), our
    <strong>legitimate interests</strong> (responding to business enquiries and securing our site),
    and <strong>legal obligation</strong> (record keeping).
  </p>

  <h2>5. Who we share data with</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell your personal data. We share it only with service providers who process it on our
    behalf under contract, including:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CRM</strong> — enquiry details are stored in our customer relationship management platform.</li>
    <li><strong>Hosting and infrastructure</strong> — our website host serves this site and processes form submissions.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — anonymised usage data, only where you have allowed analytics cookies.</li>
    <li><strong>Advertising platforms</strong> — for campaigns we run on your behalf as a client; not for tracking visitors to this website.</li>
    <li><strong>Professional advisers</strong> — accountants and legal advisers where required.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Some of these providers are located outside the UAE. Where data is transferred internationally, we
    take reasonable steps to ensure it remains protected to a comparable standard.
  </p>

  <h2>6. How long we keep data</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiry data is retained for up to 24 months from your last interaction with us unless you ask us to
    erase it sooner. Client records are retained for the duration of the engagement and for as long as
    required afterwards for legal, tax and accounting purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Subject to applicable law, you may request to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access the personal data we hold about you.</li>
    <li>Correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
    <li>Erase your data where we have no continuing lawful basis to keep it.</li>
    <li>Restrict or object to how we process it.</li>
    <li>Receive your data in a portable format.</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent at any time, without affecting processing carried out before withdrawal.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To exercise any of these rights, email <a href={`mailto:${ORG.email}`}>{ORG.email}</a>. We respond to
    verified requests within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses cookies that are strictly necessary for it to function, and
    <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> to understand how the site is used.
  </p>
  <p>
    Analytics cookies are optional. We use Google Consent Mode, which means analytics runs in a
    cookieless mode until you allow it. In the EEA, the UK and Switzerland analytics storage is
    denied by default and only enabled if you choose to allow it. Elsewhere it is enabled by
    default and you can turn it off at any time using the <strong>Cookie settings</strong> link in
    the footer of every page.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not run advertising or personalisation cookies on this website. Your IP address is
    anonymised before it reaches Google Analytics. You can also block or delete cookies in your
    browser settings; blocking strictly necessary cookies may affect how the site works.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served over HTTPS and we apply technical and organisational measures appropriate to the
    risk, including access controls and encryption in transit. No method of transmission or storage is
    completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date above always reflects the
    current version.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions or complaints about this policy or how we handle your data:
    <a href={`mailto:${ORG.email}`}>{ORG.email}</a> or {ORG.telephone}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
